+    *   Quantize $M$ as an 8-bit value directly [S1, unofficial].
+7.  **Storage:**
+    *   Store $M$ in $I.R$, $idx_1$ in $I.G$, and $idx_2$ in $I.B$ for the corresponding block location [S1, unofficial].
 
